VERDICT
==============================================================================================================
eta inclusion from the committed high-z evidence: L328 floor bounds eta <= 1.96 (1-sigma) / eta <= 1.82 (2-sigma), no lower bound (region [0, 1.82] at 2-sigma; saturation boundary eta_sep = 2.09); direct a0(z) points: eta = 0.76 +/- 0.17 (RAR arm, committed-graded non-diagnostic); KMOS3D z-trend: eta = -0.51 +/- 0.22 raw, -0.30 +/- 0.23 AD-controlled (LambdaCDM-degenerate, undecided).  Flat (eta=0) vs H(z) (eta=1): BOTH inside the floor's 2-sigma region (S(1) clears the floor by 5.6 sigma), so the high-z virial floor does NOT discriminate -- verdict = measured range, UNDECIDED, with the two direct arms straddling (RAR ~ +0.8, kinematics ~ -0.3).  Registered deep-rotator BTFR test: DATA GATE NOT MET (0/2-4 clean rotators) -- pending JWST/NIRSpec + ALMA Band 3; per-object +-0.13 dex, 3 at +-0.10 or 4 at +-0.20 dex required.

